---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const itemSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": "Premium Fruit Smoothies",
      "image": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/Images/fruit-smoothies.webp",
      "description": "Real fruit blended into thick, smooth drinks — no artificial colors or flavors. Available in Strawberry Banana, Mango Pineapple, and Triple Berry at $3.99 Small.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "3.99",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
        "url": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/items/fruit-smoothies"
      },
      "nutrition": {
        "@type": "NutritionInformation",
        "calories": "~220 cal"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much are DQ Fruit Smoothies?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Small $3.99, Medium $4.49, Large $4.99. 2026 national average prices."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What flavors do DQ smoothies come in?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Strawberry Banana, Mango Pineapple, and Triple Berry. All three use real fruit without artificial colors or flavors."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Are DQ Fruit Smoothies dairy-free?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. DQ Fruit Smoothies are made with real fruit and do not contain dairy ingredients."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Fruit Smoothies — Price, Calories & Flavors 2026" description="DQ Premium Fruit Smoothies price: from $3.99, 220+ cal. Strawberry Banana, Mango Pineapple, and Triple Berry. No artificial colors or flavors. Full 2026 guide.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li><li><a href="/categories/drinks">Drinks</a></li><li aria-current="page">Fruit Smoothies</li></ol></div></nav>

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/fruit-smoothies.webp" alt="Premium Fruit Smoothies — Dairy Queen 2026 menu item" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">Real Fruit</span><span class="badge">3 Flavors</span><span class="badge blue">~220 Cal Small</span></div>
      <h1>Premium Fruit Smoothies</h1>
      <div class="item-price-lg">From $3.99</div>
      <p>Sun-ripened whole fruit purees blended silky-smooth over crushed ice, crafted without artificial flavorings or synthetic food dyes. Offered in Strawberry Banana, Mango Pineapple, and Triple Berry profiles, providing a naturally sweet, dairy-free frozen refresher starting at $3.99.</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Starting Price</td><td>$3.99 (Small)</td></tr><tr><td>Calories (Small)</td><td>~220 cal</td></tr><tr><td>Flavors</td><td>Strawberry Banana · Mango Pineapple · Triple Berry</td></tr><tr><td>Ingredients</td><td>Real fruit — no artificial colors</td></tr><tr><td>Available At</td><td>DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories — 2026</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Small Smoothie</strong></td><td>$3.99</td><td class="price-cell">~220 cal</td><td>~0g fat</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Medium Smoothie</strong></td><td>$4.49</td><td class="price-cell">~300 cal</td><td>~0g fat</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Large Smoothie</strong></td><td>$4.99</td><td class="price-cell">~390 cal</td><td>~0g fat</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Prices are 2026 national averages. Local DQ prices may vary.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Pure Fruit Refreshment Without Artificial Additives</h2>
  <p>For patrons craving a crisp, ice-cold pick-me-up without heavy dairy fat, Dairy Queen's Premium Fruit Smoothies deliver vibrant fruit punch and velvety texture. By blending real fruit purees with micro-crushed ice, DQ creates a satisfying, thick sip that sits perfectly between a light fruit juice and an indulgent shake. Starting at $3.99 and a modest ~220 calories for a Small, it provides an energizing, guilt-free companion for sunny afternoon drives. Browse the entire beverage lineup across <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>All Three DQ Smoothie Flavors</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Flavor</th><th>Small Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strawberry Banana</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~220</td><td>Most popular — classic sweet-tart fruit combo</td></tr><tr><td>Mango Pineapple</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~240</td><td>Tropical, bright, great for summer</td></tr><tr><td>Triple Berry</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~220</td><td>Mixed berry blend — slightly tart</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>Beverage Showdown: Smoothie vs. Misty Slush vs. Hand-Spun Shake</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Premium Fruit Smoothie ($3.99 Small | ~220 cal):</strong> Thick, fruit-dense, and naturally dairy-free. Perfect for clean, plant-based hydration on warm afternoons.</li>
    <li><strong><a href="/items/misty-slush">Misty Slush ($2.39 Small | ~150 cal):</a></strong> An ultra-crisp, flavored shaved-ice classic designed for instant cooling and high value.</li>
    <li><strong><a href="/items/chocolate-shake">Hand-Spun Shake ($3.49 Small | ~710 cal):</a></strong> Rich, whole-dairy indulgence spun with signature soft serve and chocolate syrup for pure dessert satisfaction.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Dairy-Free Option</h2>
  <p>DQ Fruit Smoothies do not contain dairy — they are made with fruit purees and base ingredients. Guests who are lactose intolerant or avoiding dairy can enjoy smoothies as an alternative to shakes or Blizzards. Always confirm with your specific location if cross-contamination is a concern.</p>

  <h2>Related Drinks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/orange-julius">Orange Julius — from $3.99 (another fruity drink)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/misty-slush">Misty Slush — from $2.39 (lighter option)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/moolatte">MooLatté — from $4.29 (frozen coffee alternative)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/drinks">Full DQ Drinks Menu</a></li>
  </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much are DQ Fruit Smoothies?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Small $3.99, Medium $4.49, Large $4.99. 2026 national average prices.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What flavors do DQ smoothies come in?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Strawberry Banana, Mango Pineapple, and Triple Berry. All three use real fruit without artificial colors or flavors.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Are DQ Fruit Smoothies dairy-free?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. DQ Fruit Smoothies are made with real fruit and do not contain dairy ingredients.</div></div>
    </div></div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">
      For every DQ price, flavor, and category, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
<h2>Regional &amp; Seasonal Availability Guidelines</h2>
<p>While Premium Fruit Smoothies are staple items across most DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations during spring and summer months, some franchise locations scale back blender stations during winter freezes. To confirm current daily flavor availability before your trip, check the official app or call your closest <a href="/locations">DQ store directory</a>. All regional variations and prices are updated across <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
